<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<characters>
  <character>
    <name>Sister Sinalma</name>
    <metatype>Elf</metatype>
    <background>Brilliant former wizard and cyber surgeon at a delta grade clinic run by Aztechnology in Peru.  Got interested in HMHVV and the potential to offset essence loss from augmentation.  Used herself as a test subject, and knew everything she needed to hide her raging augmentation addiction and rapidly deepening cyberpsychosis from the rest of the research team.  Wound up wiping out half the compound when she cracked during a routine performance test.  Escaped from the smoking crater of the facility, converted to Catholicism, and is now  putting her head back together and seeking redemption as a member of a convent devoted to Santa Rosa de Lima, which happens to have interests which overlap the plot in some fashion.  Use like Hannibal Lechter from Silence of the Lambs \- friendly deeply disturbed predator that should leave the characters feeling like they're getting swimming instructions from a great white shark.</background>
